const calendarEventTypes={rain:{label:'Lluvia',color:'#FFF0AD'},delay:{label:'Retraso',color:'#FFD4BD'},change:{label:'Cambio de obra',color:'#E4D5FF'},note:{label:'Comentario',color:'#DBEAFE'}};
const calendarHistoryDialog=document.createElement('dialog');calendarHistoryDialog.id='calendarHistoryDialog';document.body.append(calendarHistoryDialog);
function calendarAuthor(){try{return $('#calendarEditor')?.value.trim()||localStorage.getItem('forja-calendar-author')||''}catch{return ''}}
function calendarRememberAuthor(name){try{localStorage.setItem('forja-calendar-author',name)}catch{}}
function calendarWhen(iso){return new Date(iso).toLocaleString('es',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'})}
function calendarEventLabel(type){return calendarEventTypes[type]?.label||'Comentario'}
function calendarStatus(){const p=data.projects.find(p=>p.id===selected),s=p?.schedule,label=$('#scheduleSaved');if(!s||!label)return;const versions=p.scheduleVersions||[],last=versions.at(-1),draft=p.scheduleDraftInfo,changed=!last||ForjaCalendar.scheduleFingerprint(s)!==ForjaCalendar.scheduleFingerprint(last.snapshot);label.textContent=(draft?'Borrador guardado: '+calendarWhen(draft.savedAt)+' · '+(draft.author||'Autor sin identificar'):'Borrador local · sin registro previo de autor o fecha')+(last?' | Última versión: V'+last.number+' · '+last.author+' · '+calendarWhen(last.savedAt):' | Todavía no hay versiones guardadas')+(changed?' | Cambios sin guardar como versión':' | Coincide con la última versión');}
const calendarCommitBeforeHistory=commitSchedule;commitSchedule=function(){const p=data.projects.find(p=>p.id===selected);if(!p)return false;const previous=p.scheduleDraftInfo;p.scheduleDraftInfo={savedAt:new Date().toISOString(),author:calendarAuthor()||null};const ok=calendarCommitBeforeHistory();if(!ok)p.scheduleDraftInfo=previous;calendarStatus();return ok};
function decorateCalendar(){if(projectPanel!=='schedule'||!getSchedule()||!$('#scheduleBody .scheduleControls'))return;const p=data.projects.find(p=>p.id===selected),s=getSchedule(),versions=p.scheduleVersions||[];
 $('#scheduleBody .scheduleControls').insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',`<div class="calendarVersionBar"><label>Responsable de esta edición<input id="calendarEditor" maxlength="100" placeholder="Nombre y apellido" value="${esc(calendarAuthor())}"></label><button class="primary" id="saveCalendarVersion">Guardar versión</button><button id="addCalendarEvent">＋ Comentario / incidencia</button></div><p class="muted calendarIdentityNote">El nombre es declarado por quien usa este navegador; no es una identidad autenticada. El guardado automático conserva el borrador. «Guardar versión» crea una copia histórica con autor y fecha.</p>`);
 $('#calendarEditor').onchange=e=>calendarRememberAuthor(e.target.value.trim());
 const header=$('#scheduleBody thead tr'),count=scheduleCount(s),eventRow=document.createElement('tr');eventRow.className='calendarEventRow';eventRow.innerHTML='<th>INCIDENCIAS DE OBRA</th><td>Por fecha</td>'+Array.from({length:count},(_,i)=>{const events=ForjaCalendar.schedulePeriodIncidents(s,i+1),type=events.length===1?events[0].type:events.length?'change':null;return `<td class="${type?'calendarEvent-'+type:''}">${events.length?`<button type="button" data-show-calendar-day="${i+1}" aria-label="Ver ${events.length} incidencia(s) del periodo ${i+1}">${events.length} ●</button>`:'—'}</td>`}).join('')+'<td>Ver detalle abajo</td>';header.after(eventRow);
 for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const events=ForjaCalendar.schedulePeriodIncidents(s,i+1);if(events.length)header.children[i+2].classList.add('calendarEvent-'+(events.length===1?events[0].type:'change'))}
 $('#scheduleBody').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="calendarLegend">${Object.entries(calendarEventTypes).map(([key,t])=>`<span><i class="calendarEvent-${key}"></i>${t.label}</span>`).join('')}</div><section class="calendarNotes" id="calendarNotes"><h2>Comentarios e incidencias</h2><p class="muted">Las incidencias conservan su fecha real aunque se cambie el inicio o la duración del cronograma.</p>${s.incidents.length?s.incidents.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)||a.createdAt.localeCompare(b.createdAt)).map(event=>{const day=ForjaCalendar.scheduleIncidentDay(s,event),inRange=day>=1&&day<=s.calendarDays;return `<article class="calendarNote calendarEvent-${event.type}"><b>${esc(calendarEventLabel(event.type))} · ${esc(event.date)} · ${inRange?'Día '+day:'Fuera del plazo actual'}</b><p>${esc(event.text)}</p><small>${esc(event.author)} · Registrado: ${esc(calendarWhen(event.createdAt))}</small></article>`}).join(''):'<p class="empty">No hay comentarios registrados. Por ejemplo: lluvia el tercer día de obra.</p>'}</section><details class="calendarHistory"><summary>Historial del cronograma · ${versions.length} versión(es)</summary><p class="muted">Las versiones guardadas no se modifican desde la app. Consultar o exportar una versión no cambia el borrador actual. El historial sigue siendo local a este navegador.</p>${versions.length?versions.slice().reverse().map(v=>`<article class="calendarVersion"><div><b>V${v.number} · ${esc(v.author)}</b><small>${esc(calendarWhen(v.savedAt))}</small><p>${esc(v.note||'Sin descripción adicional')}</p></div><button data-view-calendar-version="${v.id}">Consultar</button><button data-pdf-calendar-version="${v.id}">PDF V${v.number}</button></article>`).join(''):'<p class="empty">Guarda una primera versión para comenzar el historial. No es posible reconstruir versiones anteriores que no se guardaron.</p>'}</details>`);calendarStatus();
}
const calendarDrawBeforeHistory=drawSchedule;drawSchedule=function(){calendarDrawBeforeHistory();decorateCalendar()};drawSchedule();
function calendarWriteProject(p,changes){const before={};for(const k of Object.keys(changes)){before[k]=p[k];p[k]=changes[k]}try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(data));return true}catch{for(const k of Object.keys(changes))p[k]=before[k];toast('No se pudo guardar. Revisa el espacio del navegador.');return false}}
function openCalendarVersionForm(){const p=data.projects.find(p=>p.id===selected);if(!p?.schedule)return;calendarHistoryDialog.innerHTML=`<form id="calendarVersionForm"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Guardar versión del cronograma</h2><button type="button" data-close-calendar-dialog aria-label="Cerrar">✕</button></div><label>Responsable<input name="author" required maxlength="100" value="${esc(calendarAuthor())}" placeholder="Nombre y apellido"></label><label>Descripción de esta versión<textarea name="note" maxlength="1500" rows="3" placeholder="Ej. Reprogramación por lluvias"></textarea></label><p class="muted">Se conservarán las actividades, fechas, periodos y comentarios tal como están ahora. No reemplaza ninguna versión anterior.</p><button class="primary" type="submit">Guardar versión</button><p id="calendarVersionError" role="alert"></p></form>`;$('#calendarVersionForm').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=e.target.elements,author=f.author.value.trim();if(!author){$('#calendarVersionError').textContent='Escribe el responsable.';return}const version=ForjaCalendar.buildScheduleVersion(p,author,f.note.value);if(!calendarWriteProject(p,{scheduleVersions:[...(p.scheduleVersions||[]),version],scheduleDraftInfo:{author,savedAt:version.savedAt}}))return;calendarRememberAuthor(author);calendarHistoryDialog.close();drawSchedule();toast('Versión V'+version.number+' guardada por '+author)};calendarHistoryDialog.showModal()}
function openCalendarEventForm(){const p=data.projects.find(p=>p.id===selected),s=getSchedule();if(!s||!s.start){toast('Define primero la fecha de inicio de la obra.');return}calendarHistoryDialog.innerHTML=`<form id="calendarEventForm"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Comentario / incidencia de obra</h2><button type="button" data-close-calendar-dialog aria-label="Cerrar">✕</button></div><label>Día de obra<input name="day" type="number" required min="1" max="${s.calendarDays}" value="1"></label><p id="calendarEventDate" class="muted">Fecha: ${esc(s.start)}</p><label>Tipo<select name="type">${Object.entries(calendarEventTypes).map(([k,t])=>`<option value="${k}">${t.label}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Comentario<textarea name="text" required maxlength="2000" rows="4" placeholder="Ej. Hubo lluvia; no se pudo realizar el hormigonado."></textarea></label><label>Registrado por<input name="author" required maxlength="100" value="${esc(calendarAuthor())}"></label><p class="muted">Los colores son informativos; registrar lluvia no cambia automáticamente los periodos de trabajo.</p><button class="primary" type="submit">Guardar comentario</button><p id="calendarEventError" role="alert"></p></form>`;const f=$('#calendarEventForm').elements;f.day.oninput=()=>$('#calendarEventDate').textContent='Fecha: '+(Number.isInteger(Number(f.day.value))&&Number(f.day.value)>0?ForjaCalendar.scheduleDayISO(s.start,Number(f.day.value)):'—');$('#calendarEventForm').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const day=Number(f.day.value),author=f.author.value.trim(),text=f.text.value.trim();if(!Number.isInteger(day)||day<1||day>s.calendarDays||!author||!text){$('#calendarEventError').textContent='Completa el día, el comentario y el responsable.';return}const event={id:crypto.randomUUID(),date:ForjaCalendar.scheduleDayISO(s.start,day),type:f.type.value,text,author,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()},next=structuredClone(s);next.incidents.push(event);if(!calendarWriteProject(p,{schedule:next,scheduleDraftInfo:{author,savedAt:event.createdAt}}))return;calendarRememberAuthor(author);calendarHistoryDialog.close();drawSchedule();toast('Incidencia guardada; guarda una versión para fijar este estado del cronograma.');};calendarHistoryDialog.showModal()}
function calendarDownloadVersion(p,v){const bytes=schedulePDF(p,structuredClone(v.snapshot),v),url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([bytes],{type:'application/pdf'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='cronograma-V'+v.number+'.pdf';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),10000)}
scheduleSection.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;if(b.id==='saveCalendarVersion')openCalendarVersionForm();if(b.id==='addCalendarEvent')openCalendarEventForm();if(b.dataset.showCalendarDay){$('#calendarNotes')?.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})}const p=data.projects.find(p=>p.id===selected),id=b.dataset.viewCalendarVersion||b.dataset.pdfCalendarVersion,v=p?.scheduleVersions?.find(v=>v.id===id);if(!v)return;if(b.dataset.pdfCalendarVersion){calendarDownloadVersion(p,v);return}calendarHistoryDialog.innerHTML=`<div class="sectionhead"><h2>Versión V${v.number}</h2><button data-close-calendar-dialog aria-label="Cerrar">✕</button></div><p><b>${esc(v.author)}</b> · ${esc(calendarWhen(v.savedAt))}</p><p>${esc(v.note)}</p><p class="muted">Inicio: ${esc(v.snapshot.start)} · ${v.snapshot.calendarDays} días calendario · ${v.snapshot.rows.length} filas · ${v.snapshot.incidents?.length||0} comentario(s)</p><div class="calendarVersionRows">${v.snapshot.rows.map(r=>`<p><b>${esc(r.name)}</b>${r.group?'':' · '+esc(scheduleDuration(v.snapshot,r))+' · Días: '+esc(r.activeDays.join(', ')||'Sin programar')}</p>`).join('')}</div><button class="primary" id="downloadViewedCalendarVersion">Descargar PDF V${v.number}</button>`;$('#downloadViewedCalendarVersion').onclick=()=>calendarDownloadVersion(p,v);calendarHistoryDialog.showModal()});
calendarHistoryDialog.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('[data-close-calendar-dialog]'))calendarHistoryDialog.close()});


